@startuml C4_Code
title C4 - Code Diagram: Content Manager

class CourseController {
  +index()
  +store()
  +update()
  +destroy()
}

class ModuleController {
  +index()
  +store()
  +update()
  +destroy()
  +viewFile()
}

class LessonController {
  +store()
  +update()
  +destroy()
}

class ExamQuestionController {
  +store()
  +update()
  +destroy()
}

class Course {
  +title
  +description
}

class Module {
  +title
  +file_path
  +file_type
}

class Lesson {
  +title
  +content
  +order
}

class ExamQuestion {
  +question
  +choices
  +answer
}

class FileStorage <<external>> {
  +save()
  +delete()
  +get()
}

CourseController --> Course
ModuleController --> Module
LessonController --> Lesson
ExamQuestionController --> ExamQuestion

Course "1" o-- "many" Module
Module "1" o-- "many" Lesson
Module "1" o-- "many" ExamQuestion

ModuleController --> FileStorage : uploads / views file

note right of ModuleController
  Used by Supervisor and Admin.
  Only PDF and MP4 files allowed.
end note

@enduml